# T77 part 2 (row I168a): a foreground fetch during a slow prefetch is not held up by it. quick1 plays, the engine
# prefetches slowpf (first byte after 5 s on the fixture), and LIBRARY_FETCH of quick2 must return long before.
QUEUE_ADD modland:Protracker/test/quick1.mod
QUEUE_ADD modland:Protracker/test/slowpf.mod
PLAY
@render 1024
@sleep 500
@timed LIBRARY_FETCH modland:Protracker/test/quick2.mod
